# tally 2.2.1 P41, the fix review's F2 (P32, L §5.19 l.1726): every reading inside a window is an edge, whatever their
# number: after the second, the hole as far as the window reaches; pins 750.00, 750.00, 850.00 (review g1fix
# rtwo_min). Before W8: 850.00 PLN in silence.
=== rtwo_min.tally
model rtwo_min
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source card "invented"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input pay: money PLN
input w2: date
move pay_x: transfers
  on w2
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay
version v_card
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 100.00 PLN "c"
  w2 = window(2026-04-01, 2026-04-03) "c"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
version st2
  cite card
  governs 2026-04
  known 2026-04-10
  anchor konto
  stated[konto] = 700.00 PLN at 2026-04-01 end "s1"
  stated[konto] = 750.00 PLN at 2026-04-02 end "s2"
ask a20260403: bal(konto, 2026-04-03)
ask a20260403_p20260401: bal(konto, 2026-04-03) with w2 = 2026-04-01
ask a20260403_p20260402: bal(konto, 2026-04-03) with w2 = 2026-04-02
ask a20260403_p20260403: bal(konto, 2026-04-03) with w2 = 2026-04-03
=== expect
a20260403: ?"date within window(2026-04-01, 2026-04-03) not precise enough for a balance" (pay_x)
  unknown day: w2
  anchor: konto 2026-04-02 end, stated 750.00 PLN, difference ?"date within window(2026-04-01, 2026-04-03) not precise enough for a balance" (pay_x)
  unfulfilled: pay_x
  cut 2026-04-20
a20260403_p20260401: 750.00 PLN
  anchor: konto 2026-04-02 end, stated 750.00 PLN, difference 50.00 PLN
  cut 2026-04-20
a20260403_p20260402: 750.00 PLN
  anchor: konto 2026-04-02 end, stated 750.00 PLN, difference -50.00 PLN
  cut 2026-04-20
a20260403_p20260403: 850.00 PLN
  pinned: w2 = 2026-04-03
  anchor: konto 2026-04-02 end, stated 750.00 PLN, difference 50.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: pay_x
  cut 2026-04-20
warning: WARN-UNREAD place unexplained is read by nothing
